      "altAudio": "e502dfd9d70427c8.mp3",
      "note": "Added to the very end of a です (desu) sentence to turn it into a yes/no question, with no change to word order, e.g. アメリカじんですか (amerikajin desu ka), 'Is (he) American?' — unlike English, you don't invert word order or add a helper word.",
